(text "PAC1954 grounded ADDRSEL: 7-bit address 0x10; calibrate shunts. BQ27441 HIGH-SIDE 5 mOhm (TI pins 7/8: SRP pack side, SRN system side). +/-25 mV range: 5 A = 25 mV. Gauge is factory-calibrated for 10 mOhm: firmware must write CC Gain for 5 mOhm." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b13ca4ee-9717-5f3c-95bd-40494b754cf2"))
